					Th.
					4.8
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Arr.
				<u>An.</u>
				2.20.8
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				App.
				<u>Pun.</u>
				123
			</span></i>, etc.; 
